怨듦컻 ?꾨낫 醫뚰몴? 遺꾨━?쒕떎 */\r\n  validationPositionsPt: number[]\r\n}\r\n\r\n/** 移섏닔쨌異뺤쿃源뚯? ?뺤씤???앸궃 異??? 洹몃━???뺤쓽? 釉붾줉???????ш린???섏삩??*/\r\ninterface ValidatedSequence extends AxisSequence {\r\n  direction?: 'X' | 'Y'\r\n  spansMm: number[]\r\n  scalePtPerMm: number\r\n  totalConfirmed: boolean\r\n}\r\n\r\ntype DirectedSequence = ValidatedSequence & { direction: 'X' | 'Y' }\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?섎굹瑜??쇰꺼???곗냽?쇰줈 ?섍?瑜몃떎. `makeSegments`???쒖쓽 移몄쓣 臾띠쑝?ㅺ퀬\r\n * 留뚮뱺 洹쒖튃?대씪 ?몄젒?????싥굤??쓣 ???⑹씠濡?遺숈씤?????ㅻЪ yokohama p7?먯꽌\r\n * `bX3`(34pt 媛꾧꺽)? `cX1`???똟X3cX1?띿씠 ?먮떎.\r\n *\r\n * ?섍?瑜??쇰꺼??醫뚰몴??**洹??쇰꺼???대， 臾몄옄?ㅼ뿉??* ?ㅼ떆 ?곕떎. ?깅텇쨌蹂닿컙?쇰줈\r\n * 留뚮뱾硫??꾨㈃???녿뒗 ?꾩튂瑜??쒗뭹???뺥븯??寃껋씠 ?섍퀬, 洹??꾩튂媛 洹몃?濡??ㅽ뙩\r\n * 移섏닔??以묒젏 ?먯젙???곗씤??\r\n *\r\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?꾩껜媛 ?쇰꺼濡??④??놁씠 ?ㅻ챸???뚮쭔 諛쏅뒗??\r\n */\r\nfunction splitAxisLabels(\r\n  segment: TextSegment,\r\n  y: number,\r\n  rowSegments: TextSegment[],\r\n): LabelToken[] {\r\n  // NFKC媛 ??湲?먮? ?щ윭 湲?먮줈 ?대뒗 寃쎌슦媛 ?덉쑝誘濡?1:1??媛?뺥븯吏 ?딄퀬\r\n  // 臾몄옄留덈떎 ?띿뒪?몄긽??援ш컙??湲곕줉???섏갼?붾떎\r\n  let text = ''\r\n  const spans: Array<{ start: number; end: number; item: TextItem }> = []\r\n  for (const item of segment.items) {\r\n    const piece = compact(item.str)\r\n    if (piece === '') continue\r\n    spans.push({ start: text.length, end: text.length + piece.length, item })\r\n    text += piece\r\n  }\r\n  if (text === '') return []\r\n\r\n  const tokens: LabelToken[] = []\r\n  if (/^[a-z]?[XY]/.test(text)) {\r\n    AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex = 0\r\n    while (AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex < text.length) {\r\n      const start = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\r\n      const match = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.exec(text)\r\n      if (!match) return []\r\n      const end = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\r\n\r\n      const owned = spans\r\n        .filter((span) => span.start < end && span.end > start)\r\n        .map((span) => span.item)\r\n      if (owned.length === 0) return []\r\n\r\n      let minX = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n      let maxX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFIN